# shellcheckrc for fleet-ops
# These scripts are copies of production scripts that use intentional patterns.
# Each disabled code is a deliberate choice, not an oversight.
#
# SC1090: Can't follow non-constant source. siterep-deploy and
#   siterep-deploy-rollback source $CREDS_FILE for wrangler credentials.
#   The path is intentionally variable; values are never printed.
# SC2016: Expressions don't expand in single quotes. siterep-deploy-rollback
#   builds a gh issue body with literal backtick fences (markdown), not command
#   substitution. The single quotes are correct.
# SC2164: cd without || exit. Every script uses set -euo pipefail, so a
#   failed cd exits the script already. Adding || exit would be redundant.
disable=SC1090,SC2016,SC2164
